```css
/* main.css — the order is declared once, up front */
@layer reset, base, components, utilities;

@import url("reset.css") layer(reset);
@import url("base.css") layer(base);
@import url("buttons.css") layer(components);
@import url("utilities.css") layer(utilities);
```

| Layer | Contains | Selector style |
|---|---|---|
| reset. | normalise browser defaults. | element selectors. |
| base. | typography, links, tokens. | element selectors. |
| components. | `.card`, `.btn`, `.nav`. | single classes. |
| utilities. | `.u-hidden`, `.u-mt-4`. | single classes; win by layer order. |

